  "description": "Add bold femininity and romantic beauty to your designs with this Lipsticks & Roses Digital Paper Pattern Pack. This seamless pattern blends stylish lipstick elements with elegant roses, creating a chic and glamorous aesthetic perfect for beauty-inspired and floral-themed projects.\nEach digital paper tile is designed to repeat smoothly, making it ideal for scrapbooking, planners, stationery, packaging, printable crafts, branding accents, and surface pattern collections. The combination of makeup and floral motifs delivers a modern yet romantic look that works beautifully for fashion, beauty, and lifestyle designs.\nThese high-resolution seamless digital papers are perfect for designers and crafters who love feminine aesthetics, makeup themes, and elegant floral artwork.\n👉 You will receive [37] seamless digital paper pattern tiles, suitable for print and digital use.\nWhat’s Included\n– [37] Seamless digital paper pattern tiles (JPEG)\n– Size: 3072 × 3072 px\n– Lipstick & rose repeating pattern designs\n– Fully editable: resize, recolor, rotate, or layer\nKey Features\n– Seamless repeating lipstick & rose pattern\n– Feminine beauty and floral aesthetic\n– Elegant romantic color palette\n– High-resolution printable quality\n– Designed for digital paper & surface pattern use\nPerfect For\n– Scrapbooking & digital paper packs\n– Planners, journals & stationery\n– Beauty & fashion themed designs\n– Packaging & branding accents\n– Printable crafts & decor\n– Surface pattern design collections\nNote\nThis is a digital product only. No physical item will be shipped.\nColors may vary slightly depending on screen and printer settings.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Add bold femininity and romantic beauty to your designs with this Lipsticks &amp; Roses Digital Paper Pattern Pack. This seamless pattern blends stylish lipstick elements with elegant roses, creating a chic and glamorous aesthetic perfect for beauty-inspired and floral-themed projects.</p>\n<p>Each digital paper tile is designed to repeat smoothly, making it ideal for scrapbooking, planners, stationery, packaging, printable crafts, branding accents, and surface pattern collections. The combination of makeup and floral motifs delivers a modern yet romantic look that works beautifully for fashion, beauty, and lifestyle designs.</p>\n<p>These high-resolution seamless digital papers are perfect for designers and crafters who love feminine aesthetics, makeup themes, and elegant floral artwork.</p>\n<p>👉 You will receive [37] seamless digital paper pattern tiles, suitable for print and digital use.</p>\n<p>What’s Included</p>\n<p>– [37] Seamless digital paper pattern tiles (JPEG)<br>\n– Size: 3072 × 3072 px<br>\n– Lipstick &amp; rose repeating pattern designs<br>\n– Fully editable: resize, recolor, rotate, or layer</p>\n<p>Key Features</p>\n<p>– Seamless repeating lipstick &amp; rose pattern<br>\n– Feminine beauty and floral aesthetic<br>\n– Elegant romantic color palette<br>\n– High-resolution printable quality<br>\n– Designed for digital paper &amp; surface pattern use</p>\n<p>Perfect For</p>\n<p>– Scrapbooking &amp; digital paper packs<br>\n– Planners, journals &amp; stationery<br>\n– Beauty &amp; fashion themed designs<br>\n– Packaging &amp; branding accents<br>\n– Printable crafts &amp; decor<br>\n– Surface pattern design collections</p>\n<p>Note</p>\n<p>This is a digital product only. No physical item will be shipped.<br>\nColors may vary slightly depending on screen and printer settings.</p>",
